udent participation in hands-on activities and discussions.","type":"strength"},{"text":"Students demonstrate genuine interest and curiosity in the subject matter.","type":"strength"},{"text":"Ensure all students have an equitable opportunity to share their thoughts.","type":"improvement","technique":"Equitable Participation"},{"text":"Incorporate more opportunities for students to lead discussions.","type":"improvement","technique":"Student-Led Discussion"}]},{"name":"technology","label":"Good","score":3,"narrative":"The teacher effectively used projected images as visual aids to support content, and a student interacted with the projected image at the board. However, there were limited opportunities for students to engage with interactive digital tools or manipulate content dynamically.","factors":[{"text":"Effective use of projected images as visual aids to support content.","type":"strength"},{"text":"Seamless integration of technology without technical disruptions.","type":"strength"},{"text":"Explore opportunities to incorporate more interactive digital tools or simulations.","type":"improvement","technique":"Interactive Digital Tools"},{"text":"Consider having students use technology for research or presentation.","type":"improvement","technique":"Student Technology Use"}]}],"performance_summary":{"key_strengths":[{"text":"Excellent student engagement through hands-on activities","dimension":"Engagement"},{"text":"Clear and accurate scientific explanations","dimension":"Clarity"}],"areas_for_improvement":[{"text":"Behaviour management during transitions needs strengthening","dimension":"Behaviour Management"},{"text":"Technology use is limited to passive projection","dimension":"Technology"}]}}',
